div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 13.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31 Ago)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 14.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31 Out)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4:<\/strong> 15.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 22 Nov)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 5:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 2 Dez)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Sanfil<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 18:31<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">8.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre Sanfil Medicina<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 15:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong>. As provas jovens come\u00e7am \u00e0s 15h15 e a corrida principal de 10 km tem partida \u00e0s <strong>18h30<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o limite de participantes no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O limite m\u00e1ximo est\u00e1 fixado em <strong>5.000 inscritos<\/strong> no conjunto de todas as dist\u00e2ncias para garantir a seguran\u00e7a e conforto dos atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando se faz o levantamento dos kits de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega dos kits decorre na quinta-feira (17h00 \u00e0s 20h00), sexta-feira (10h00 \u00e0s 20h00) e s\u00e1bado at\u00e9 \u00e0s 17h00 em local designado no centro de Coimbra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima permitida para a corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida de 10 km tem uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de <strong>2 horas<\/strong>, terminando \u00e0s 20h30, hora em que \u00e9 restabelecida a circula\u00e7\u00e3o rodovi\u00e1ria.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As crian\u00e7as podem participar gratuitamente na caminhada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 9 anos t\u00eam inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita na Caminhada de 5 km (sem direito a kit oficial de participante).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua Larga \/ Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Escola de Atletismo de Coimbra \/ A. R. Casaense e C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Coimbra 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de Dezembro de 2026 . As provas jovens come\u00e7am \u00e0s 15h15 e a corrida principal de 10 km tem partida \u00e0s 18h30 .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o limite de participantes no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O limite m\u00e1ximo est\u00e1 fixado em 5.000 inscritos no conjunto de todas as dist\u00e2ncias para garantir a seguran\u00e7a e conforto dos atletas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando se faz o levantamento dos kits de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega dos kits decorre na quinta-feira (17h00 \u00e0s 20h00), sexta-feira (10h00 \u00e0s 20h00) e s\u00e1bado at\u00e9 \u00e0s 17h00 em local designado no centro de Coimbra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima permitida para a corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A corrida de 10 km tem uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 2 horas , terminando \u00e0s 20h30, hora em que \u00e9 restabelecida a circula\u00e7\u00e3o rodovi\u00e1ria.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As crian\u00e7as podem participar gratuitamente na caminhada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, as crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 9 anos t\u00eam inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita na Caminhada de 5 km (sem direito a kit oficial de participante).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66346,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[28,672,27,624,47],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-53142","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-coimbra","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-kids","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/sao-silvestre-de-coimbra-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53142","targetHints":{"allow